James Skillett and his passenger caught up to the Morris Miner at a roundabout. Pulling alongside it, James's passenger wound down his window and James lent over him. He shouted, Are you fucking mad or something? He walked to get off the fucking road. The driver of the Morris Miner looked over and laughed before driving off. The car haphazardly drifted out of sight. Earlier that morning at 5.20, a young man named John Kerr had started work for the day. He had a job with the Ministry of Transport, counting the number of cars that passed by
詹姆斯·斯基利特和他的乘客在一个环岛追上了那辆莫里斯矿工汽车。车子并排停下时，詹姆斯的乘客摇下车窗，詹姆斯探过身去。他大喊道：“你他妈是疯了还是怎么的？把车开下他妈的路！”莫里斯矿工汽车的司机看了他们一眼，大笑了一声，然后开车离去。这辆车摇摇晃晃地驶出了视线。那天清晨5点20分，一个名叫约翰·克尔（John Kerr）的年轻男子开始了一天的工作。他在交通部找到了一份工作，负责统计经过……

