a specific location on the A6 motorway near Deadman's Hill. At 6.45am, he crossed over a grassy knoll and came across the bloodied bodies of Michael Gregston and Valerie Story. Detective Superintendent Robert Acott of Scotland Yard was assigned to the murder investigation. With 28 years' experience under his belt, he was confident the perpetrator would soon be found. Details of Michael's Morris Miner were circulated throughout the press and at 6.00 that night, Detective Acott received the first break in the case.
A6高速公路死人山附近特定地点的汽车数量。早上6点45分，他走过一个草地丘陵，偶然发现了迈克尔·格雷格斯顿和瓦莱丽·斯托里的血泊尸体。苏格兰场（Scotland Yard）的侦探督察罗伯特·阿科特（Robert Acott）被指派负责这起谋杀案的调查。凭借28年的丰富经验，他坚信凶手很快就会被绳之以法。迈克尔的莫里斯矿工汽车的细节在媒体上广泛传播，当晚6点，阿科特侦探迎来了案件的第一个突破。

