00:17:24.000 --> 00:18:07.000
A man walking his dog on Avondale Crescent in Ilford spotted the Morris Miner parked on the street at an odd angle. The front registration plate was damaged and there was blood spatter inside and outside the vehicle. A local resident reported the car having been parked there since 7.45am. There were no foreign fibres, hair or fingerprints present throughout the vehicle. However, two empty 38-caliber cartridge cases were found within. They matched similar cases found at the crime scene.
一名在伊尔福德（Ilford）阿文代尔新月（Avondale Crescent）遛狗的男子发现这辆莫里斯矿工汽车以奇怪的角度停在街上。前车牌损坏了，车内和车外都有血迹溅落。一位当地居民报告说，这辆车从早上7点45分起就一直停在那里。车内没有发现外来纤维、毛发或指纹。然而，车内发现了两个空的.38口径弹壳。它们与犯罪现场发现的类似弹壳相吻合。

