00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:51.000
The next morning of August 24, housewife Audrey Willis heard a knock at the back door of her house in Old Nebworth, approximately 37 miles north of where the Morris Miner was found. According to the Guardian, Audrey opened the door to find a man wearing a long grey raincoat, dark trousers and brown shoes. He was around 30 years old with a pale and long, thin face and dark, deep-set eyes. The man inquired as to whether her husband was home. When Audrey replied that he was out, the man presented a black revolver from his pocket and forced his way inside.
第二天早上，即8月24日，家庭主妇奥黛丽·威利斯（Audrey Willis）听到有人敲她位于奥尔德内布沃思（Old Nebworth）家后门的声音，这里距离发现莫里斯矿工汽车的地方以北约37英里。据《卫报》（The Guardian）报道，奥黛丽打开门，看到一个穿着长款灰色雨衣、深色裤子和棕色鞋子的男人。他大约30岁，脸色苍白，脸型修长消瘦，有一双深陷的黑眼睛。这名男子打听她的丈夫是否在家。当奥黛丽回答说他不在时，男子从口袋里掏出一把黑色左轮手枪，强行闯入屋内。

28
00:18:51.000 --> 00:19:35.000
He asked Audrey for money and something to eat. She gave him four pounds and some milk and cookies. After he had drunk the milk and pocketed the biscuits, he asked Audrey to remove her shoes and go with him to the back door. As she did as requested, the man took off. A search of the area failed to find the intruder. Detectives believed that this incident was related to the A-6 attack on Dead Man's Hill. After that evening, Cleaner for London Transport Edwin Cook was doing his job inspecting the
他向奥黛丽索要钱财和吃的。她给了他四英镑以及一些牛奶和饼干。在他喝完牛奶并把饼干放进口袋后，他要求奥黛丽脱下鞋子，和他一起走到后门。正如她所要求的，男人逃跑了。对该地区的搜查未能找到闯入者。侦探们认为这起事件与死人山A6袭击案有关。那天晚上过后，伦敦交通局（London Transport）的清洁工埃德温·库克（Edwin Cook）正在伦敦南部佩克汉姆（Peckham）的赖兰车库（Rye Lane Garage）检查公交车。

