00:19:35.000 --> 00:20:25.000
buses at Rye Lane Garage in Peckham, South London. As he searched the rear of the A-36 bus for rubbish, he lifted the back seat. According to author Paul Foot, Edwin made a habit of checking this seat on every bus he cleaned after once coming across two dead rats nestled in the space. On this occasion, Edwin Cook lifted up the seat and found a dirty handkerchief. Underneath was a fully loaded revolver and five boxes of ammunition. The gun was quickly confirmed to be the .38 caliber used in the A-6 attack. The cleaner was positive the weapon and accessories had been deposited there that day as he had
当他在A-36公交车后部寻找垃圾时，他掀起了后座。据作家保罗·福特（Paul Foot）称，埃德温养成了一个习惯：在他清洁的每一辆公交车上，只要检查过一次座位发现里面藏着两只死老鼠后，他每次都会检查这个座位。这一次，埃德温·库克掀起座位，发现了一块脏手帕。手帕下面是一把上满子弹的左轮手枪和五盒弹药。经迅速证实，这把枪正是A6袭击案中使用的.38口径手枪。清洁工确信该武器和配件是当天被放在那里的，因为他……

