00:25:16.000 --> 00:25:58.000
The third man had stayed in room 24 on August 21, the night before the shooting. Jim Ryan In late September 1961, Charlotte France appeared at Scotland Yard. It had been a month since the A6 shooting, and Charlotte had a growing suspicion towards someone she knew well. A week after the attack, the France family hosted a longtime family friend, Jim Ryan, at their council flat in St. John's Wood. He'd slept on their sofa and was otherwise his typical self.
第三个男人在枪击事件发生前一晚（即8月21日）住在24号房间。他就是吉姆·瑞安。1961年9月下旬，夏洛特·弗兰茨（Charlotte France）出现在苏格兰场。距离A6枪击案已经过去了一个月，夏洛特对她非常熟悉的一个人产生了越来越多的怀疑。袭击发生一周后，弗兰茨一家在他们位于圣约翰伍德的市政公寓里接待了一位多年的老朋友吉姆·瑞安。他睡在他们的沙发上，表现得和往常一样。

